# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:16
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On this page, you can find different ways to find online help and "
"additional information provided by the &kde; community."
msgstr "अस्मिन् पृष्ठे भवन्तः &kde; समुदाय।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:20
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; UserBase"
msgstr "&कुत्र; UserBase इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:21
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/An_introduction_to_KDE\""
">An Introduction to &kde;</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/An_introduction_to_KDE\">&"
"kde;</ulink> इत्यस्य परिचयः&nbsp;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:25
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Learn more about the <ulink url=\"https://kde.org/community/whatiskde/\"> "
"&kde; community and its software</ulink> and find information to help you "
"get started. Also, discover what <ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Welcome_to_KDE_UserBase\""
"> UserBase</ulink> is and how it can help you."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://kde.org/community/whatiskde/\"> &kde; समुदायः तस्य "
"सॉफ्टवेयर</ulink> च तथा च भवतः आरम्भे सहायकं सूचनां अन्वेष्टुम्। अपि च, "
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Welcome_to_KDE_UserBase\""
"> UserBase</ulink> इति किम्, कथं च भवतः सहायतां कर्तुं शक्नोति इति "
"अन्वेष्टुम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:33
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Getting_Help\">Getting "
"Help</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/सहायता_प्राप्तिः\""
">सहायतां प्राप्तुं</ulink>&nbsp;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:36
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Need some help? Here are some suggested places where you can get help with "
"problems, as well some hints on how to improve the quality of answers you "
"receive."
msgstr ""
"किञ्चित् साहाय्यस्य आवश्यकता अस्ति वा ? अत्र केचन सुझाताः स्थानानि सन्ति "
"यत्र भवन्तः समस्यासु सहायतां प्राप्तुं शक्नुवन्ति, तथैव भवन्तः प्राप्तानां "
"उत्तराणां गुणवत्तां कथं सुधारयितुम् अर्हन्ति इति केचन संकेताः अपि सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:42
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Applications\""
">Applications</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Applications\">अनुप्रयोग</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:45
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Discover the wide variety of applications from the &kde; Community, and "
"find out what program suits your needs and preferences."
msgstr ""
"&kde; समुदायः, तथा च ज्ञातव्यं यत् कोऽपि कार्यक्रमः भवतः आवश्यकतानां "
"प्राधान्यानां च अनुकूलः अस्ति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:51
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Tutorials\">Tutorials</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr ""
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:myLanguage/Tutorials\">पाठ्यक्रमाः</"
"ulink>&nbsp;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:54
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How-To's, Tips &amp; Tricks that can help make your &kde; software "
"experience more enjoyable and productive."
msgstr ""
"How-To's, युक्तयः &amp; युक्तयः ये भवतः &kde; सॉफ्टवेयर अनुभवः अधिकं "
"आनन्ददायकः उत्पादकः च।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:63
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Forum"
msgstr "&कुत्र; मञ्चः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:64
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<ulink url=\"https://forum.kde.org/\">&kde; Community Forums</ulink>&nbsp;"
msgstr "<ulink url=\"https://forum.kde.org/\">&kde; सामुदायिकमञ्चाः</ulink>&nbsp;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:67
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kde; Forums offer users, developers and people interested in &kde; a "
"place to help each other, discuss &kde;-related topics and exchange ideas. "
"You can find <ulink "
"url=\"https://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?f=14/\">Tutorials &amp; "
"Tips</ulink> in the forum."
msgstr ""
"इति &kde; मञ्चाः उपयोक्तृभ्यः, विकासकान्, &kde; परस्परं साहाय्यं कर्तुं, "
"&kde;-सम्बद्धविषयेषु चर्चां कर्तुं, विचाराणां आदानप्रदानं कर्तुं च स्थानम्। "
"भवन्तः <ulink url=\"https://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?f=14/\">पाठ्यक्रमाः "
"&amp; मञ्चे युक्तयः</ulink> इति ।"

